Hello Mennatullah,

=20

Thank you for your application to UBC Statistics.=20

=20

There was a lot of competition for this position and we=E2=80=99re now interviewi=
ng shortlisted candidates.=20

=20

We regularly post new job openings on Academic Jobs Online, UBC Career page=
, and the UBC Statistics website, so please keep an eye on those platforms i=
f you are interested in future opportunities.

=20

Thank you again for your time and effort in applying.=20

=20

I wish you the best of luck in your job search!

=20

All the best,

=20

Ah Young Kim (She, Her, Hers) on behalf of the Search Committee
Executive Assistant to the Head and Communications Coordinator
Faculty of Science | Department of Statistics=20
The University of British Columbia | Vancouver Campus | Musqueam Traditiona=
