Subject: Inquiry on Stat. Position

=20

Hello Dr. Natalia Nolde,

=20

      I am an applicant in the position for assistant professor in the Stat=
istics department in UBC. I am also an affiliate assistant professor, hence =
why I have the email. I wanted to inquire if the interview process has alrea=
dy begun and if the position was filled or not yet?

=20

Looking forward to your response,

Best regards,

Mennatullah


